<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Infrared Vision</ansi> mutation

The Chrysalis rewrites your optic nerves entirely. You see heat,
motion, the hidden shapes of living things — but the old spectrum
dims and fades.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Eyes
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  See clearly in complete darkness
  Detect hidden creatures by their body heat — concealment offers
  less protection against you

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced perception — conventional sight dims as the
  heat-spectrum dominates your vision

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Night Vision, Keen Eyes

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
